{"name":"Beauty Queen","hex":"#be5c87","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"beauty queen","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The female winner of a beauty contest."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beauty_queen"}],"entries":[{"title":"Beauty Queen (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Beauty Queen is a Philippine television drama series broadcast by GMA Network. Directed by Joel Lamangan, it stars Iza Calzado in the title role. It premiered on October 18, 2010, on the network's Telebabad line-up. The series concluded on February 4, 2011, with a total of 80 episodes."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6c/Beauty_Queen_title_card.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty_Queen_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q4877895"},{"title":"Beauty Queen (Lash song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Beauty Queen\" is a song by Australian pop-punk band Lash. It was released in August 2001 as the group's second single from their album, The Beautiful and the Damned (2002). The song peaked at number 31 on the ARIA charts. The song also appears on the soundtrack, Freaky Friday, for the 2003 Disney film of the same name, along with \"Take Me Away\", covered by actress Christina Vidal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/12/Beauty_Queen_by_Lash.png/330px-Beauty_Queen_by_Lash.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty_Queen_(Lash_song)","wikidata":"Q86755757"},{"title":"Beauty pageant","blocks":[{"text":"A beauty pageant is a competition in which the contestants are judged and ranked based on various physical and mental attributes. Per its name, beauty pageants traditionally focus on judging the contestants' physical attractiveness, sometimes solely so, but most modern beauty pageants have since expanded to also judge contestants based on \"inner beauty\"—their individual traits and characteristics, including personality, intelligence, aptitude, moral character, and charity. Though typically perceived as a female-oriented competition, male beauty pageants also exist, as do child beauty pageants for youth."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Miss_Universe_1930_Winners.jpg/330px-Miss_Universe_1930_Winners.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty_pageant","wikidata":"Q2658935"},{"title":"Beauty","blocks":[{"text":"Beauty is commonly described as a feature of objects that makes them pleasurable to perceive. Such objects include landscapes, sunsets, humans and works of art. Beauty, art and taste are the main subjects of aesthetics, one of the fields of study within philosophy. As a positive aesthetic value, it is contrasted with ugliness as its negative counterpart."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Rozeta_Pary%C5%BC_notre-dame_chalger.jpg/330px-Rozeta_Pary%C5%BC_notre-dame_chalger.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty","wikidata":"Q7242"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Isa_Calsado_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Isa_Calsado_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Isa_Calsado_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Isa_Calsado_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIsa_Calsado_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Katrina_Halili_in_New_Jersey.jpg/500px-Katrina_Halili_in_New_Jersey.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Katrina_Ha